 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9925154936099205`*^9, {3.9925207395711823`*^9, 3.9925207701768284`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"05d027d3-d885-3441-94bc-27ad7579e281"],

Cell["\<\
El manejo de materiales radiactivos requiere estrictas medidas de seguridad \
para proteger a los individuos de la exposici\[OAcute]n a radiaci\[OAcute]n. \
Esto incluye el uso de blindaje adecuado, monitoreo de radiaci\[OAcute]n, y \
pr\[AAcute]cticas seguras de manejo. 

La comprensi\[OAcute]n de la inestabilidad nuclear y la radiactividad es \
esencial para aprovechar las aplicaciones beneficiosas de la \
radiaci\[OAcute]n en la medicina, al tiempo que se minimizan los riesgos \
asociados con su uso.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.984350296726103*^9, 3.984350312105961*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"764b6b95-8dd0-e84f-858a-ff7db2c58a0d"],

Cell["\<\
La estructura nuclear es posible debido a la energ\[IAcute]a de ligadura que \
mantiene unidos los protones y neutrones en un volumen muy peque\[NTilde]o \
(algunos fentometros) debido a la fuerza nuclear.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9530649721703463`*^9, 3.953064988003974*^9}, {
   3.953065028655744*^9, 3.95306503663035*^9}, {3.953993265456999*^9, 
   3.9539932670006466`*^9}, 3.9539958208560524`*^9, {3.9539972114610806`*^9, 
   3.9539972394074345`*^9}, 3.953997764637501*^9, 3.9539985110723934`*^9, {
   3.9540153071080246`*^9, 3.954015320124756*^9}, {3.9540153895780296`*^9, 
   3.9540153996936893`*^9}, {3.984350379212265*^9, 3.984350429960722*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"d4df2037-d460-c643-b497-ea5d7cbd34f8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "La expresi\[OAcute]n exacta para la fuerza nuclear es extremadamente \
compleja. Sin embargo, algunas de sus caracter\[IAcute]sticas generales son \
las siguientes:\n- La fuerza nuclear es enormemente atractiva y mucho m\
\[AAcute]s grande en magnitud que las fuerzas electrost\[AAcute]tica y \
gravitacional entre nucleones.\n- La fuerza nuclear es de muy corto alcance; \
esto es: un nucle\[OAcute]n s\[OAcute]lo interact\[UAcute]a con sus vecinos m\
\[AAcute]s cercanos, a trav\[EAcute]s de distancias del orden de ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "15"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1cc07976-2966-1848-a622-44f992f7f21a"],
 " m.\n- La fuerza nuclear es independiente de la carga el\[EAcute]ctrica; \
esto es: resulta en la misma fuerza entre cualesquier dos nucleones: dos \
protones, un prot\[OAcute]n y un neutr\[OAcute]n, o dos neutrones."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9530649721703463`*^9, 3.953064988003974*^9}, {
   3.953065028655744*^9, 3.95306503663035*^9}, {3.953993265456999*^9, 
   3.9539932670006466`*^9}, 3.9539958208560524`*^9, {3.9539972114610806`*^9, 
   3.9539972394074345`*^9}, 3.953997764637501*^9, 3.9539985110723934`*^9, {
   3.9540153071080246`*^9, 3.954015320124756*^9}, {3.9540153895780296`*^9, 
   3.9540153996936893`*^9}, {3.984350379212265*^9, 3.9843504328879585`*^9}, 
   3.9925196468158455`*^9},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"e8413da1-6149-e242-ada9-e1a0b651ef13"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "La inestabilidad nuclear implica la emisi\[OAcute]n de energ\[IAcute]a, en \
forma de part\[IAcute]culas, hasta que el mismo alcance su estabilidad \
nuclear. \n\nLa cantidad f\[IAcute]sica que relaciona la cantidad de energ\
\[IAcute]a emitida por los n\[UAcute]cleos inestables se denomina actividad \
radiol\[OAcute]gica (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["R", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "R", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e332c9c8-f982-bb45-863c-4fe19da7be01"],
 ")."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9843504802578106`*^9, {3.984350604593607*^9, 3.9843506135409946`*^9}, 
   3.992519691311943*^9},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"537fb496-0d79-4143-b9de-e12bc9d393f3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["R", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "-", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
          StyleBox["N", "TI"]}], 
        RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
   "R = -\\frac {\\Delta N} {\\Delta t}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
  "TeXAssistantTemplate"]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9843504566188335`*^9, 3.9843504609043617`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"08f05a24-2808-fe44-8274-54ce977503c3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Adem\[AAcute]s, es posible calcular la actividad radiol\[OAcute]gica (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["R", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "R", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ce0f4f9e-fa03-cd42-83bb-cefd88c2ae92"],
 ") de una sustancia como la relaci\[OAcute]n de la constante de decaimiento \
(",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[Lambda]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\lambda", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4d6a21c4-90da-f547-bf15-3849d13c2a77"],
 ") y la cantidad de n\[UAcute]cleos inestables existentes (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["N", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "N", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "561d1adf-a497-5348-8481-39a871833e78"],
 ")"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9843504985361385`*^9, {3.984350617818922*^9, 3.984350648774933*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"e9fcf0e3-945d-8043-8742-d4ec48810549"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["R", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "\[Lambda]", 
       StyleBox["N", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
   "R = \\lambda N", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
  "TeXAssistantTemplate"]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.984350521417198*^9, 3.9843505240942097`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"865e0863-23f5-6d4b-b838-1fa493d312d4"],

Cell["\<\
Al proceso de la emisi\[OAcute]n de energ\[IAcute]a en forma de \
part\[IAcute]culas hacia afuera del n\[UAcute]cleo inestable se denomina \
decaimiento radiactivo, el cual tiene un comportamiento exponencial:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9843505088645325`*^9},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.91, 0.88],ExpressionUUID->"d42deb95-0712-ac45-baf7-bbe66bdd3f05"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["N", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["N", "TI"], "0"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"-", "\[Lambda]", 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
   "N = N_ 0 e^{-\\lambda t}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
  "TeXAssistantTemplate"]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9843505346411285`*^9, 3.984350538542742*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"6600cfff-f821-704e-ad96-bf0f568226ec"],

Cell["\<\
En el decaimiento radiactivo, por tener un comportamiento exponencial, es \
posible determinar el tiempo que tarda una sustancia en reducir la mitad de \
los n\[UAcute]cleos inestables. 

Este tiempo es el considerado como periodo de semi-desintegraci\[OAcute]n \
(vida media) y puede ser calculado en t\[EAcute]rminos de la constante de \
desintegraci\[OAcute]n:\
\>", "Text",
 CellFrame->{{0, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.946578547563545*^9, 3.946578570864743*^9}, 
   3.9539926880385723`*^9, {3.953993167714464*^9, 3.953993202776102*^9}, {
   3.953997256844839*^9, 3.9539972837587585`*^9}, {3.9539973687132645`*^9, 
   3.953997370447798*^9}, 3.953998061072016*^9, {3.9539981199532356`*^9, 
   3.95399814844816*^9}, {3.953998319052103*^9, 3.953998449750841*^9}, {
   3.9540048169842987`*^9, 3.9540048363944435`*^9}, 3.954014901420683*^9, 
   3.954014949448761*^9, 3.954015562197695*^9, {3.954016968321081*^9, 
   3.9540169763784523`*^9}, {3.9843506695158844`*^9, 3.984350686904663*^9}, {
   3.9843507511862392`*^9, 3.9843507516157722`*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.87, 0.94, 1],ExpressionUUID->"c17e89a9-991f-f947-8cd6-f83dd32f33ed"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
     RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"ln", "(", "2", ")"}], "\[Lambda]"], "\[TildeTilde]", 
       FractionBox["0.693", "\[Lambda]"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
   "input" -> 
   "t_ {1/2} = \\frac {\\ln (2)} {\\lambda} \\approx \\frac {0.693} \
{\\lambda}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
  "TeXAssistantTemplate"]], "DisplayFormulaNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9843507026206226`*^9, 3.9843507426165695`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"95e006ea-e777-5a42-96b3-399fde58c0fe"],

